rs, and lovers.\n\n- Floria: She is 19 years old and has a pink hair (but the color is a little darker than Nami), one of her eyes is yellow/golden, the other is green/blue/or you can choose if you want to make the atomosphere better). She is a gentle and elegent girl, also like a sister or leader.\n\nI would like a cute atmosphere. The composition, background and pose is up to you!\n\nCharacters Ref (You can choose anyone clothes you want)\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jB1Orr4aWL8Ah0yrq3dVPEvUGx0UeSjo?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@minamo_o0/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2974153, "client_id": 619606, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3fc3d3c6/uploads/origins/4f5cceea-4a23-4e8b-a548-7cb1a09a9bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbb44c7fe2c95dd019fdddbc8f29ac0e", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3fc3d3c6/uploads/origins/4f5cceea-4a23-4e8b-a548-7cb1a09a9bba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=11b3412b4fd827b856092e50f2d751f1", "src_set": ""}, "body": "みなせもも様、初めまして\nもし可能であれば、この子を描いてくれませんか？\n\n海世くらりん\n彼女はクラゲをイメージしたキャラで、髪色は水色＋ピンクとなります。目の色はゴールドです。\n彼女は天真爛漫で陽気な子、水族館巡りが趣味です。海にあるものがすきで、塩辛ものが嫌いです。\n\n服装もポーズはすべてみなせもも様にお任せ致します\nフォルダー内の衣装でも大丈夫ですし、新しいお洋服やみなせもも様のお好きなように、服装をアレンジなどして頂いても構いません。\n\nご検討のほどよろしくお願いします。\nありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/119VwbMvU0zXMwB1QjMQ58lvYnIaX7UkA", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@minamo_o0/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2974153, "client_id": 2